{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411150","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1341115001:1":{"text":"석양 국화, 향기풀, 오렌지꽃, 벨플라워 씨앗...","source_cn":"夕菊、异香草、橙花、响铃花的种子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BD25B2A5D4C4A7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1341115002:1":{"text":"팔라모르 씨, 뭘 정리하고 있나요?","source_cn":"法拉莫尔先生，你在清点什么啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39037E1CAB043E39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1341115003:1":{"text":"해미 양. 꽃바다에서 찾은 식물들을 정리하고 있었답니다. 약용 가치가 아주 뛰어나거든요.","source_cn":"漫漫女士，这是我在这片花海里找到的一些植物，它们的药用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x890A261D10D70460","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1341115004:1":{"text":"석양 국화로는 외상약을 만들 수 있고, 오렌지꽃은 달콤하면서도 기운을 북돋아 주는 차를 끓일 수 있지요. 벨플라워 씨앗은 갈았을 때 방충 효과가 뛰어나답니다. ","source_cn":"夕菊能够调制一种外敷的伤药；橙花可以泡茶，味道甘甜又提...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x443614ABFC376945","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1341115005:1":{"text":"이런 효능들이 있었군요! 아, 그런데 향기풀은 무슨 효과가 있나요?","source_cn":"原来这些花草还有这样的功效啊。对了，那异香草有什么作用呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x433F64EC33383BD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1341115006:1":{"text":"향기풀은...","source_cn":"异香草啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x099FC411E3F3C4EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1341115006":{"text":"향기풀은...","source_cn":"异香草啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x099FC411E3F3C4EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1341115007:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 말이 맞습니다. 대부분은 향기풀로 훈향이나 향낭을 만들거든요.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7A3EF1C45BD2B9B1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 말이 맞습니다. 대부분은 향기풀로 훈향이나 향낭을 만들거든요.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 말이 맞습니다. 대부분은 향기풀로 훈향이나 향낭을 만들거든요.","variant_male_record_index":"150063","variant_female_record_index":"150064","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1341115007":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 말이 맞습니다. 대부분은 향기풀로 훈향이나 향낭을 만들거든요.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>说得不错，很多人会用它来制作熏香或者香袋。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7A3EF1C45BD2B9B1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 말이 맞습니다. 대부분은 향기풀로 훈향이나 향낭을 만들거든요.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 말이 맞습니다. 대부분은 향기풀로 훈향이나 향낭을 만들거든요.","variant_male_record_index":"150063","variant_female_record_index":"150064","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1341115008:1":{"text":"저는, 음... 훈향으로 쓰진 않아요. 향기풀의 향기가 퍼지면 제 후각에 조금 부담이 되거든요.","source_cn":"我，嗯……我的确不用它来做熏香。对我而言，异香草的味道...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F8840042EE25613","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1341115009:1":{"text":"하지만 다른 유용한 걸 만들 수 있어요. 이상초 세 송이에 검은콩 한 줌, 거기에 약간의 지방을 섞으면 털을 윤기나게 만드는 연고를 만들 수 있으니까요...","source_cn":"但它另有功效。实际上，只要三颗异香草、一把黑夹豆再加少...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39C7DBB476973197","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1341115010:1":{"text":"아, 팔라모르 씨는 이렇게 머리카락 관리를 하시는군요! 어쩐지 깔끔하고 매끄러워 보이더라니, 만졌을 때 느낌도 정말 좋고요! ","source_cn":"呀，原来法拉莫尔先生是这样保养毛发的！怪不得你的发辫看...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B3F0DE16E9E61C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1341115011:1":{"text":"크흠... 깔끔한 외모는 상대방에 대한 존중이라고 생각하거든요.","source_cn":"咳……我认为，整洁的外表也是一种对他人的尊重。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x860B58DE6B86C55D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1341115012:1":{"text":"네, 저도 동의해요! 전 깔끔한 사람이 좋거든요. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님과 팔라모르 씨 처럼요!","source_cn":"嗯嗯，我赞同！我最喜欢清爽干净的人了，就像<style...","status":